30, 1998 relating to the offering of 150,000 Units of Limited Partnership
Interest in Smith Barney Diversified Futures Fund L.P. II (the "Partnership").
The Supplement includes financial statements of the Partnership, Smith Barney
Holdings Inc. and its wholly owned subsidiary Smith Barney Futures Management
Inc. (the "General Partner") for the year ended December 31, 1997, performance
of the General Partner and the Partnership's advisors through January 31, 1998
