officer of ARA and is solely responsible for all management and trading
decisions made by ARA. Mr. Arulpragasam received his B.S. in mathematics from
Massachusetts Institute of Technology following which he pursued graduate
studies in operations research at Stanford University.
 
     In November of 1979 Mr. Arulpragasam went to work for a company that Mr.
