analysis of technical factors, fundamentals and market action, to trade futures,
forward, spot and option contracts in the currency, financial and metals
markets. In the CFM program, Mr. Yang utilizes the various Willowbridge
strategies to provide the disciplined technical and fundamental analysis of the
markets and also to help determine risk management procedures.
 
